<title>UK: Suddeutsche Bodencreditbank sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Suddeutsche Bodencreditbank sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUDDEUTSCHE BODENCREDITBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY    11.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    14.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 11.APR.97 THEN STEPS-UP TO 5.00 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		CALLABLE ON 11.APR.97 AT PAR.</p>
<p>		OFFENTLICHER PFANDBRIEF SERIES 267</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
